00:29:38.443 --> 00:29:41.679 align:start size:94% position:6%
to their favorite
non-profits and charities.

00:29:41.679 --> 00:29:43.581
It's been very successful.

00:29:43.581 --> 00:29:46.084
It's raised millions,

00:29:46.084 --> 00:29:49.354 align:start position:0%
it raises millions and
millions of dollars every year.

